class_name MomentCard
extends CueCard
## The words over a moment (`Lake._start_owed_moment`): the first animal back, the swarm, the
## first honey, the first tornado. Low in the window so what it is about stays in the middle,
## clicks passing through. Since 2026-10-07 it is a `CueCard` and wears its moment's theme
## (`kind`, the moment's own); this name stays for the harness and the probes.
